(18, 'web_1766518002177_23hpuiwj5', 'assistant', 'Ya, mahasiswa di FATEK diwajibkan mengumpulkan poin ekstrakurikuler minimal sesuai ketentuan program studi sebelum dapat mengikuti tugas akhir.  \nJika belum memenuhi poin ekstrakurikuler, mahasiswa tidak dapat melanjutkan ke tahap tugas akhir, sehingga pada praktiknya tidak bisa lulus tanpa memenuhi syarat tersebut.  \n\nSemoga membantu! 😊', '[{\"score\": 0.468, \"source\": \"SINEMA Website Info.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.449, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.438, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.428, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.426, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.426, \"source\": \"PANDUAN SATUAN POIN EKSTRAKURIKULER Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.42, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.414, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.414, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.409, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.408, \"source\": \"Modul Integritas Akademik FATEK UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.407, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.407, \"source\": \"PANDUAN SATUAN POIN EKSTRAKURIKULER Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.405, \"source\": \"PANDUAN SATUAN POIN EKSTRAKURIKULER Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.403, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.401, \"source\": \"Modul Integritas Akademik FATEK UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.398, \"source\": \"PANDUAN AKADEMIK FATEK 2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.395, \"source\": \"Buku  Panduan TA Non Skripsi Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.394, \"source\": \"Buku  Panduan TA Non Skripsi Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.393, \"source\": \"Modul Integritas Akademik FATEK UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.39, \"source\": \"Buku  Panduan TA Non Skripsi Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.389, \"source\": \"P