(193, 'web_1767780792660_3n1xf2ba3', 'user', 'Jika IPK saya 2,40, bisa ambil jalur mana saja?', '[]', NULL, 0, '2026-01-09 02:38:00', NULL),
(194, 'web_1767780792660_3n1xf2ba3', 'assistant', 'Dengan IPK **2,40** kamu memenuhi syarat untuk jalur **Skripsi** (normal).  \nJalur **Non‑Skripsi** (karya prestasi, publikasi, proyek) memerlukan IPK minimal **2,50**, jadi tidak dapat dipilih.\n\n**Jalur yang bisa diambil:**\n- **Skripsi**  \n  - Seminar Proposal: 120 SKS, IPK minimal **2,00**  \n  - Ujian Sidang: 144 SKS, IPK minimal **2,00**\n\n**Jalur yang tidak memenuhi:**\n- **Non‑Skripsi** (karya prestasi, publikasi, proyek)  \n  - Syarat umum: 120 SKS, IPK minimal **2,50**\n\nSemoga membantu! 😊', '[{\"score\": 0.454, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.431, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.43, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.426, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.413, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.406, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.404, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.395, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.395, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.393, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.363, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.361, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.356, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.351, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.347, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.346, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.339, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.327, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}]', 14.622685670852661, 0, '2026-01-09 02:38:15', NULL),
