(196, 'web_1767780792660_3n1xf2ba3', 'assistant', '⚠️ **Batas penggunaan harian tercapai**\n\nMaaf, limit API gratis (50 request/hari) sudah habis. \nSilakan coba lagi besok atau hubungi admin untuk upgrade akun.\n\n💡 **Tips:** Limit akan reset setiap hari pada pukul 00:00 UTC.', '[{\"score\": 0.429, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.428, \"source\": \"Modul_Integritas_Akademik_FATEK_UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.413, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.408, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.401, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.395, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.393, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.392, \"source\": \"Modul_Integritas_Akademik_FATEK_UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.383, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.379, \"source\": \"Modul_Integritas_Akademik_FATEK_UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.378, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_SATUAN_POIN_EKSTRAKURIKULER_Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.375, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.369, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.369, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.367, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_SATUAN_POIN_EKSTRAKURIKULER_Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.364, \"source\": \"Modul_Integritas_Akademik_FATEK_UNTAD_2.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.363, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.36, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}]', 6.259060859680176, 0, '2026-01-09 02:38:58', NULL),
(197, 'web_1766518002177_23hpuiwj5', 'user', 'Apa syarat untuk mendapatkan transkrip TEM?', '[]', NULL, 0, '2026-01-12 20:48:27', NULL),
(198, 'web_1766518002177_23hpuiwj5', 'assistant', '**Persyaratan untuk Mendapatkan Transkrip Ekstrakurikuler Mahasiswa (TEM)**  \n\n- **PKKMB**: Harus memiliki minimal satu kegiatan PKKMB yang sudah diverifikasi.  \n- **Bakti Lingkungan**: Harus memiliki minimal satu kegiatan bakti lingkungan yang sudah diverifikasi.  \n\nPastikan kedua kegiatan tersebut sudah terverifikasi di portal akademik sebelum mengajukan permohonan TEM. 😊', '[{\"score\": 0.63, \"source\": \"SINEMA_Website_Info.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.594, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_SATUAN_POIN_EKSTRAKURIKULER_Fix.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.57, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.57, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.541, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_SATUAN_POIN_EKSTRAKURIKULER_Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.535, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_SATUAN_POIN_EKSTRAKURIKULER_Fix.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.513, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_SATUAN_POIN_EKSTRAKURIKULER_Fix.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.498, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.48, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.472, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.471, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.466, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.46, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.457, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.456, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.451, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.451, \"source\": \"PANDUAN_AKADEMIK_FATEK_2025-2026.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.45, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.449, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.pdf\"}, {\"score\": 0.449, \"source\": \"Buku_Panduan_TA_Non_Skripsi_Finish.md\"}, {\"score\": 0.448, \"source\": \"SINEMA_Website_Info.md\"}, {\